3320 0 obj
  << /ActualText (I am an engaged and creative person who recently completed my Multimedia Design degree at KEA\056 I am now seeking a position where I can apply my skills in digital design and web development\056 I have experience in website development\054 including both UX\057UI design and coding\054 with a solid knowledge of HTML\054 CSS\054 and JavaScript\056\n\nAs a colleague\054 I am helpful and flexible\056 I thrive both independently and in team environments\054 and I have strong experience in achieving effective teamwork through the use of various collaboration tools\056\n\nAdditionally\054 I am a structured and responsible person who values thoroughness and punctuality\054 especially when it comes to meeting deadlines\056 I have project management experience from my studies\054 working with methods such as Double Diamond\054 Gantt charts\054 WBS\054 and Trello\056\n\nOutside of the screen\054 I have a creative side\072 I am an artist and I love painting\056 It is my greatest passion in life\056 This has sharpened my eye for color\054 composition\054 and visual communication\056\n\nI value clear communication and constructive feedback when working in iterative design processes\056\n\nIf you are curious to see my work\054 please take a look at my )
     /K [ 3 ]
     /P 3323 0 R
     /Pg 1041 0 R
